window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><b>Last night, I tried to drink away my feelings for my brother's best friend.<br> Today I’m riding across a dangerous, desert wasteland with him.</b><br> <br> When Torrance Knight steps up to make this dangerous ride with me, I’m both relieved and dreading the journey.<br> <br> He’s pure sin wrapped in a tall, leather package. I’ve been in love with him for years, but he’s too busy breaking the heart of every girl in town to notice me, let alone return my feelings.<br> <br> I have to protect my heart while also pretending to be his wife. Not only that, I have to focus on our mission. And if we don’t make it home, can I summon the courage to tell him how I feel?<br> <br> Even worse, how do I handle being in love with him, survive this task, while also falling for someone new?<br> <br> <b><i>Vengeful Gods MC: The Complete Series</i></b><i> is a dystopian whychoose/reverse harem series with fantasy and motorcycle club elements. This series takes place in the same world as </i><b><i>Steel Demons MC</i></b><i> and </i><b><i>Their Property: Sons of Odin MC.</i></b><br> <br> <b>This collection contains the following books:<br> -Faithless<br> -Harmless<br> -Deathless</b></p>"; 
